{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是毕业典礼的日子。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的班会结束后，\\n教室里依然热闹非凡。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "放学后的班会结束后，教室里依然热闹非凡。", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在新学年到来之前，如果没有社团活动或者个人往来，\\n大伙之后就不会再碰面了。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "在新学年到来之前，如果没有社团活动或者个人往来，大伙之后就不会再碰面了。", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各务台学院的男生，以及结女校的女生。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如今这副场景和男女混校没什么区别。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一开始还在担心之后会变成什么样子来着，\\n　现在回过神来，时间可过得可真快啊～」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「我一开始还在担心之后会变成什么样子来着，　现在回过神来，时间可过得可真快啊～」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1759", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。大家都得明年再见了啊」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么一想，稍微有点寂寞啊。\\n　放寒假本来应该挺开心的」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「这么一想，稍微有点寂寞啊。　放寒假本来应该挺开心的」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1760", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于没有参加社团活动的人来说，这种感觉可能会更深一些。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室里的氛围和以往差别很大。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "并不让人感到呼吸困难，让人想就这么一直待下去。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以大伙才不那么急着回家吧。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为了留校的同学，\\n　安洁给大家准备了珍藏的红茶」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "「为了留校的同学，　安洁给大家准备了珍藏的红茶」", "plain_idx": 253, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3974", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来吧来吧，还请大家尽情享用～♪」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3975", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……感觉好像错失了回家的时机啊」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6590", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我要不来一杯吧～」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4404", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哈哈，实际上里面是不是加了些奇怪的药什么的～」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1761", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3976", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，你好好否定我就行了。\\n　别笑得那么怪啊」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「不是，你好好否定我就行了。　别笑得那么怪啊」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1762", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁开始给大家分发红茶，\\n教室里变得愈发喧闹起来。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "安洁开始给大家分发红茶，教室里变得愈发喧闹起来。", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我要不也来一杯吧」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，瓜生。可以占用一下时间吗？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0006", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我正准备去找安洁拿红茶的时候，\\n旁边一个女生跟我搭了话。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "我正准备去找安洁拿红茶的时候，旁边一个女生跟我搭了话。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我之前一直就很想问了，\\n　瓜生，你有在和女生交往吗？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "「我之前一直就很想问了，　瓜生，你有在和女生交往吗？」", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0007", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "意料之外的问题抛来，班级里瞬间安静了下来。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一上来就打直球啊」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1763", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家应该都很好奇吧？\\n　瓜生有没有在和谁谈恋爱」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「大家应该都很好奇吧？　瓜生有没有在和谁谈恋爱」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0008", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，很好奇～」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0000", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各务台校男生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没准他就是和班里某个女生在一起了呢～」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_dc0000", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "莫名受到班里同学的注视，\\n我挠了挠头看了一圈周围。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "莫名受到班里同学的注视，我挠了挠头看了一圈周围。", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我这时候要是看向纱凪，恐怕会被大伙猜到。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4405", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把纱凪当作背景板的一部分，环视时扫到了她的表情。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她似乎十分不安。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来纱凪现在依然想在班里同学面前隐藏我们的关系。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……任你想象」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，不带你这么敷衍的～！」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0001", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你其实有女朋友了对吧～？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0009", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所谓好男人，可不能把这种事全盘托出啊。\\n　你说是吧，新吾？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「所谓好男人，可不能把这种事全盘托出啊。　你说是吧，新吾？」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1764", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太立刻插进来圆场道。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "托他的福，场面总算平息了下来。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3977", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一边，安洁在远处露出了为难的表情。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说不定是发现了我和纱凪的事情。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，红茶不赶紧发下去可都要凉了哦？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6591", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？！是的是的。\\n　来吧，大家不用客气都来尝尝吧～♪」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "「啊？！是的是的。　来吧，大家不用客气都来尝尝吧～♪」", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3978", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在社团成员之间保密应该就是极限了吧。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪是怎么想的呢……", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安洁好像知道咱俩的事了」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4406", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，是吗？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "等到大家离开，我和纱凪凑到一起聊天。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没想到，安洁已经察觉了我们之间的关系。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那她刚才怎么没跟着起哄呢」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁知道呢……」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4407", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说，社团里不知道的就只有美羽学姐了啊」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4408", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只对学姐一个人保密，\\n感觉有点别扭。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "只对学姐一个人保密，感觉有点别扭。", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还不告诉美羽学姐吗？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。能再多保密一段时间吗？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4409", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「倒也不是不行，主要是以你的想法为准」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4410", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我感觉自己还算不上」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4411", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算不上？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我感觉自己还做不到挺起胸膛说自己是你的女朋友」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「嗯。我感觉自己还做不到挺起胸膛说自己是你的女朋友」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4412", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，嗯，再等一段时间……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4413", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这也不是靠其他人的评价就能解决的问题。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能一心一意地为纱凪着想。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接下来会怎样，就取决于纱凪怎么想了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾和纱纱还没来呢」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3315", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不过我感觉他们应该也快来了……\\n　要不要去叫一下他们？」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「嗯，不过我感觉他们应该也快来了……　要不要去叫一下他们？」", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6592", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，他们不在正好，\\n　大家圣诞节有什么安排？」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「不用，他们不在正好，　大家圣诞节有什么安排？」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3316", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没安排」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5380", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然安洁有幸很受大家的欢迎，不过……\\n　不不不，一个人孤苦伶仃地熬过圣诞节这种事，\\n　肯定是不会发生在安洁身上的」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": "「虽然安洁有幸很受大家的欢迎，不过……　不不不，一个人孤苦伶仃地熬过圣诞节这种事，　肯定是不会发生在安洁身上的」", "plain_idx": 364, "len": 60, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3979", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你就老老实实地说没有安排就行了」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6593", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有空……不知道瓜生和纱凪怎么样」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6594", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我哥好像很忙」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5381", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱还要和新吾同学“唔呵呵”呢～」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "「纱纱还要和新吾同学“唔呵呵”呢～」", "plain_idx": 372, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3980", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，安洁？！」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6595", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，是啊。所以可以的话，\\n　圣诞节那天我想让他俩好好休息一下」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "「呵呵呵，是啊。所以可以的话，　圣诞节那天我想让他俩好好休息一下」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3317", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6596", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也会挤出些时间的，\\n　咱们排班两人一组，应该能轮一圈？」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「我也会挤出些时间的，　咱们排班两人一组，应该能轮一圈？」", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3318", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下。\\n　天羽学姐，你发现……瓜生他俩的事情了吗？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": "「等、等一下。　天羽学姐，你发现……瓜生他俩的事情了吗？」", "plain_idx": 385, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6597", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，他们俩是在交往吧？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3319", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁也是从美羽同学那里听来的，\\n　震惊得我差点翻了个跟头～」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": "「安洁也是从美羽同学那里听来的，　震惊得我差点翻了个跟头～」", "plain_idx": 390, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3981", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说，安洁是从美羽学姐那里得知的他俩的事情？」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "「也就是说，安洁是从美羽学姐那里得知的他俩的事情？」", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6598", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。她还让我对其他人保密呢～」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "「是的。她还让我对其他人保密呢～」", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3982", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样啊」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6599", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，为什么要瞒着纱凪他们\\n　你已经知道了呢？」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "「但是，为什么要瞒着纱凪他们　你已经知道了呢？」", "plain_idx": 399, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6600", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3320", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱啊」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3321", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想等她自己来告诉我」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3322", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱她一定……」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3323", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她一定会亲口和我说的——」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "「她一定会亲口和我说的——」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3324", "char_id": "みう"}]}
